{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AshBall</strong> is a fast-paced, minimalist co-op platformer where two players must coordinate their movements and pass a single ball to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lava never stops rising. Players must pass the ball back and forth to open new paths, control the pace of danger, and avoid instant death. But if you hold the ball for too long, the lava accelerates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight physics, reactive arenas, and a striking black-and-red aesthetic, AshBall tests your timing, trust, and teamwork. This is not a game of brute force \u2014 it's a test of rhythm, cooperation, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're laughing or screaming, AshBall is best experienced with a friend. Can you both make it to the end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799920?t=1760120588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799920?t=1760120588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799920/de5cda11a8459cf41cc0c0943016c0e8fc27e4fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760120588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799920/de5cda11a8459cf41cc0c0943016c0e8fc27e4fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760120588","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4082050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AshBall</strong> is a fast-paced, minimalist co-op platformer where two players must coordinate their movements and pass a single ball to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lava never stops rising. Players must pass the ball back and forth to open new paths, control the pace of danger, and avoid instant death. But if you hold the ball for too long, the lava accelerates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight physics, reactive arenas, and a striking black-and-red aesthetic, AshBall tests your timing, trust, and teamwork. This is not a game of brute force \u2014 it's a test of rhythm, cooperation, and nerve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're laughing or screaming, AshBall is best experienced with a friend. Can you both make it to the end?</p>","developers":["Kyaoo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799920/cfdafbadc81852bb8f319f0ca949ce38100b0cf7/header.jpg?t=1760120588","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799920/90245409/2663774e88967250b48e59505878864749c94479/1751196153/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751230851","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799920/90245409/2663774e88967250b48e59505878864749c94479/1751196153/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751230851","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3799920/90245409/2663774e88967250b48e59505878864749c94479/1751196153/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751230851","id":257162909,"name":"AshBall","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162909/74a6dd2aca3c706eced01db4a7cc482f128a8ae8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751230851"}],"name":"AshBall","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (Intel HD Graphics 3000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<stro